i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T-HfoBRJFoQQ7kNvwHoLK7_&_nc_oc=Adrhe9Nc-q4Xcgr8Nkd_xdcx2rCwWHX8YvhnFGGkwoNHluu2E03sPULJxw8tjkZK7lg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8yS_jtsHrbYrAqvTABj56QbTGlDLAm-XTj83BYAAoDfw&oe=6A467EE6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f3B_i0ZtJO8Q7kNvwGW0wt8&_nc_oc=Ado-KwZGVcBIazg0Jwm1od-V6i00JVMCJ6GrF9f7qgw_O0KqJq9BcwV4wD-H_oS9Lg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8XSBX1-c-MAu12dC61lDXHjh6XfZO1iShfk718IyzUXw&oe=6A467432"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2YZMj2dJs60Q7kNvwFCS_Q_&_nc_oc=Adr7jQqbO6ugNxDA8rWbNfXtDEMZ-dIkD7WFjPG81HDyNpOn4oj86rLXyHRl2npgzNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9HeljNpqwwgAZuAAt-O5_ssVvoFdX741fjDMGG3AHzvg&oe=6A466DFB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4qXKhA926ywQ7kNvwFYP2lX&_nc_oc=AdpagKXai5v7irh-SDebn5Z28xcMW9ZnVfJyjfvrdtKOVygqoBiLqkTIgb_bwFzp9gI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_DCY-HUn1xin1rMgsw9zMly-2IvqNuaxdI0mY6wVTq-g&oe=6A468373"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MiLQ9cg9YjcQ7kNvwHHXnwk&_nc_oc=AdqxKcoZnrD0pwDt_10cpRQFutELiokppBWIfcTeAM_qYSu9vdyNrD6Wanp4mCEpE_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ebE0vw-AaAgePi7jFmnq8_UNe5ohVeIjCswNSa8Ymgw&oe=6A468172"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UW4f3i5H4aYQ7kNvwEak37Z&_nc_oc=AdrWsKf8xZAaeuMSNkTVZ27WY31EB4PPcouTpq3ZV-UC-iutY-E3j_fIYz4hPEoJmaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_rmtxyV-67iny_e73lU7QNF7kunfYUjckoJklahfcj0Q&oe=6A4678D3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTZGhPrvrLoQ7kNvwFIm9jd&_nc_oc=AdqfRv9nLdkKknyy1lhsCCC8x1AROyvFixkMQdXl7FYgZewlmeGHx3VbMO184EX2Ha8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Hqs-QVrRdtAx7W60Y1XSkwhaWNRe3nef4xFevd5ThcQ&oe=6A4674EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uZ7Zt4a-gnMQ7kNvwHMof9j&_nc_oc=AdpCW3l_vrmJbIo2aCYryrRrPi2IOIgyUfCzAa75E69qSxS3-XVH27unOGNC51sgAQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8VvTK7ZGo5EQuqFVT8lwsg2Imkqki9BJlvIGl_GsCE6w&oe=6A4680A2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_